                <mxCell id="259" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;For all the properties mentioned in the bin object npm automatically create CLI/shell file&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;In window,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;for them for all kind of terminal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;In linux only for shell&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="258" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="30" width="340" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="233" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;npm problems&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#1ba1e2;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="626.25" y="-490" width="383.75" height="260" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle x="690" y="-430" width="60" height="30" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="234" value="1. Package duplication: - Before npm v3, dependencies were &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;installed exactly according to the dependency grap&lt;/span&gt;h, which makes deeply nested node_moduels&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Duplicaiton problem&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A single folder have tens of thousands of files would make the filesystem lookups slower, also window often hit max_path limit for nested folders&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="233" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="30" width="383.75" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="240" value="2. Phantom dependency: - Starting npm v3 (flattened), npm tried to hoist as many dependencies to the top level node_modules folder&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;This &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;solves the deeply nesting problem,&lt;/span&gt; but &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 153, 153));&quot;&gt;introduced phantom dependency problem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="233" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="170" width="383.75" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
